  "description": "Whether you fit the \"rad like dad\" category looking for something to ride with your kids or perhaps you're just a really big kid who needs a larger size bike, the Shredder Pro 24 is a versatile model which can accommodate a wide variety of riders. Hi-ten steel frame construction along with 24\" alloy rim wheels and 990 style alloy brakes make this model every bit capable of doing some shredding.\nHi-ten frame with 21\" top tube\n1 1/8\" hi-ten threadless fork\n7\" hi-ten bars with Haro alloy top load stem\n39/16t gearing\nHaro padded fully adjustable seat\nKenda K-Rad 24 x 1.95\" tires\nAlloy 990 brake",
